WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.240
We finally know the identity of Doma's secret leader: Dartz.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:43.070
He heads Paradius, the conglomerate that controls the world's economy and governments.

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:51.670
But at the Rock Wasteland, I saw him fight Duel Monsters in the ancient past.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.890
Is Dartz the one who destroyed Atlantis?

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:01.900
Clash!  Jonouchi vs Valon

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.560
Wait, Jonouchi!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.180
It's dangerous over there!  Jonouchi!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.360
What?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.120
Oh no!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.650
Run!

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:26.470
Watch where you're going!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.130
Wait!

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.460
That way's dangerous!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.460
A monster!

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.640
H-Help me!

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.360
It's coming!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.710
Damn!  In that case...

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.730
Jonouchi?

00:02:58.690 --> 00:02:59.790
What?

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.100
You're...

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.530
Follow me, Jonouchi!

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.760
Wait!

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:11.470
Hey!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.700
Dammit!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.280
I'm borrowing this.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:23.650
Wait, Jonouchi!

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:27.590
That idiot!  It may be a trap!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.320
Stop!

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.200
You punk!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.070
Damn!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.010
You won't get away!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:11.960
Damn!

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:35.950
Damn!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.730
How's that!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.860
That's nothing special.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:53.740
What?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.870
Follow me!

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.060
Hey!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:06.690
Big brother!

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.050
Yugi!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.960
Big brother!  I'm glad you're all right.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:17.660
Of course.  We uncovered the enemy's identity.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.040
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.000
I'll end Doma.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.860
We better hurry.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.040
Jonouchi went to Paradius alone!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.570
What?  Jonouchi?

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.970
That fool doesn't know his place.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.980
Big trouble!  Jonouchi and Honda left!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:34.550
Anzu!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.710
The monsters that attacked Yugi are over there!

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.400
What?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.980
Let's go!  We can catch up if we take the car!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.290
Looks like something's started.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.170
Grandpa.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.970
Professor Hopkins.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:57.900
The news said people are losing consciousness worldwide, as if they've lost their souls.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:59.570
Can it be?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.110
Are the ruins' inscriptions coming true?

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.260
The police are also under Doma's control.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:11.350
We have to handle this by ourselves.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:16.580
Let's go!  We must stop Doma and save everyone!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.290
Wait for me, partner.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.420
The time is coming.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.820
Jonouchi!  Where are you?

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:56.850
Jonouchi?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.760
Honda!  Where's Jonouchi?

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:02.930
Mai?

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:05.300
Isn't Jonouchi with you?

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.740
What are you talking about?

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:10.680
Valon took Jonouchi somewhere!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.630
What did you do with Jonouchi?

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.780
Valon?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.990
It's entirely your fault!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.720
I'll never forgive you if anything happens to him!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.650
Hey!

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.650
Wait!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.700
This place will suffice.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.680
Nobody will bother us here.

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.450
Valon, where's Mai?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.200
What's the point of asking?

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.580
Mai isn't your ally anymore.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:51.390
You're wrong!  I promise to bring Mai back with me!

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.690
You don't get it.

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:55.320
What?

00:07:55.320 --> 00:08:03.880
You can't understand how she thinks, how she suffers, how she wants to defeat you.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.000
Only I can!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.680
That's not true!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:11.050
Mai is my-  She's one of us!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:16.000
Why would she pick you over her friends who fought beside her?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.700
I chose to fight you.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.450
Say what?

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.930
She must be joking!

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:31.170
You'll never understand because you always keep moving forward.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.140
Listen, Jonouchi.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.890
I'm not fighting for Doma this time.

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.330
I'll defeat you for Mai!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.270
What do you mean?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:46.100
Mai will keep suffering as long as you exist.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:52.300
Even if she fights you and wins!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.820
She'd be hurt worse.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.980
Who she cares for is...

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.600
You're in the way!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.270
For both me and Mai!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.920
I'll defeat you here!

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:15.160
If you really want to fight, I accept!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.410
Duel!

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.610
I go first!  I draw!

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:27.510
I summon Alligator's Sword in attack position!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.710
I end my turn.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:35.390
What kind of strategy does Valon use?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.820
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:42.190
My fighting style is to always attack.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:45.760
I'll show you the power of my invincible Armor Deck!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.700
Armor Deck?

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:52.670
I summon Psychic Armor Head in attack position!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:59.390
You summoned a monster with 0 attack points in attack position?

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:04.080
Yes!  Psychic Armor Head doesn't have any attack points!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.820
But this begins summoning armor with an invincible attack!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.750
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:15.290
Armored Gravitation!

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.130
Armored Gravitation?

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:21.820
I summon Trap Buster in attack position!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.500
I summon Big Bang Blow in attack position!

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:32.510
I summon Over Boost in attack position!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.640
I summon Active Guard in attack position!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:37.920
Here I go!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.000
Armored Gravitation!

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.090
What?

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:14.650
Due to the spell card Armored Gravitation's effect...

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:18.990
...I can Special Summon Level 4 or lower Armor monsters!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:23.310
Jonouchi, I'll show you the power of my Armor monsters!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.040
It's begun.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:58.530
Valon vs Jonouchi.  Whoever loses, his soul will be mine.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:04.530
Fire up your souls to resurrection my god.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.070
This road leads straight to Paradius.

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:13.450
Time to invade their HQ, brother!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:14.880
It's too quiet.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:22.330
Knowing their previous actions, they wouldn't let us approach without resistance.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:35.130
Where did Jonouchi go?

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.650
Another one!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.000
What's going on?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.740
Otogi!  Be careful!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.100
Honda!

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.420
Bring it on!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.360
Celtic Guardian!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:11.720
Honda!

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:12.330
Guys!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.340
Yugi, what's going on?

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:17.270
Who were they?

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:22.530
Ghosts that perished in Atlantis 10,000 years ago have resurrected.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:24.580
Ghosts from Atlantis?

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.100
Where's Jonouchi?

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.490
I thought he was with you.

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:34.700
He was, but he went with Valon, one of Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.520
What?

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:37.850
That's not good!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.460
Jonouchi is in danger!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.420
What do you mean?

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:48.900
His terrifying deck has monsters we've never seen before.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:52.470
Everyone!  Let's find Jonouchi!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:57.220
No time to worry about that chump.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:58.580
Kaiba?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:13:59.910
Look around.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.950
Brother...

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.060
We're surrounded.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:25.210
He instantly summoned five monsters.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:29.140
But why is he wearing them?

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:34.810
Armor Monsters not only protect me, but they're also weapons to attack with.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:39.530
But they all have 0 attack points!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:41.760
How can you attack?

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:46.290
I'll show you the true power of my Armor Monsters!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:49.770
Opponent player has 4000 life points.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:54.730
Opponent's monster: Alligator's Sword - 1500 attack points.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:59.060
Scanning for set cards: None on field.

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:05.250
Big Bang Blow-Active Guard combo: Monster destruction 99% probability.

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.650
Here I go, Jonouchi!

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.480
Big Bang Blow attacks Alligator's Sword!

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:15.120
Attacking with 0 attack points?  What's he thinking?

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.760
Alligator's Sword!  Counterattack!

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:26.800
Big Bang Blow destroys all enemies!  Both yours and mine!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:27.970
What?

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.310
I activate Big Bang Blow's effect!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.550
Activating Active Guard's effect.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.550
Absorbing damage.

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:54.940
What just happened?

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:57.100
Why did I lose life points?

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:03.460
When Big Bang Blow is destroyed in battle, all monsters on the field are destroyed.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:10.410
Both players receive damage equal to the destroyed monsters' total attack points!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:13.350
What?  But you didn't lose life points!

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:15.430
Because I have this.

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:21.650
Active Guard's effect reduces the damage I take to 0.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:22.940
What?

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:27.360
Combo cleared.  All armor vanishes.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.900
All the monsters are gone, but I take no damage!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.760
How's that, Jonouchi?

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.840
This is the power of my Armor Deck!

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.700
Bring it on, Jonouchi!  It's your turn!

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.580
What?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:47.450
You're ending your turn without a defending monster or a set card?

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:52.150
You only summoned monsters to attack?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.560
My dueling style is to only attack!

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:59.240
I don't play tricks or games!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.720
This is how I've lived all my life.

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.770
In a town similar to this one.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.600
Stop, Valon!

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:14.060
If you don't, I won't forgive you!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:16.380
Valon.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.810
Why do you fight all the time?

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:23.900
OK.  Finished.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.240
Hey!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.180
You're still here?

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.030
Our boss bought this property.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.120
So leave!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.150
Please wait!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:36.320
We still have many children here!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.130
So what?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:41.600
Leave by the end of the day!  Got it?

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:43.810
Valon!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.790
No...

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:08.350
Since it's old, it burns well.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.070
Saved us the trouble of tearing it down.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.240
Come out.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:09.190
I see.  I like the look on your face.

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.610
How's it living here?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:17.620
If you don't change, you'll stay here for a long time.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:20.580
Yes, a long time.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:26.640
But what if there's a way to get out immediately?

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:29.310
I'll give you that chance.

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.660
Use this and battle.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:36.050
The sole survivor will be freed.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.820
But if you lose, it's over.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.730
You know what I mean.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:44.020
What will you do?  You choose.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.220
You're strong.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.550
Who are you?

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:28.530
You're free, as promised.

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:32.590
But don't you want to fight stronger opponents?

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:36.580
Interesting.  Let me fight!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.250
I want to fight stronger enemies!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:42.520
I accept you as a member of Doma.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.480
But I'll say one thing:

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:47.050
I may defeat you in the future.

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:54.810
I gave up holding on to anything special long ago.

00:20:54.810 --> 00:21:00.400
Unlike Rafael, Amelda or you, I have nothing that burdens me.

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.020
I fight to win!

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:05.840
To keep winning is everything!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.320
I can understand.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:12.340
I'd probably agree with him if I was the same person I used to be.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:16.220
Back then, I fought all the time.

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:18.460
I only cared about winning.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:23.820
But I learned that wasn't real strength.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.940
After meeting Yugi and dueling various opponents.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:33.040
It wasn't always fun, but I learned what's important.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:38.140
Dueling isn't a tool to hurt others!

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:41.740
I can't lose to someone like you!

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:46.570
Interesting.  If you think you can defeat me, go ahead and try!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:07.110
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:15.520
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:26.610
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:36.130
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:45.160
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:50.670
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:55.850
For me to be me

00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:04.310
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:09.950
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:19.680
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.900 --> 00:23:30.180
Valon sees Jonouchi as a rival for Mai.

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:34.460
Accepting the challenge, the two begin their duel.

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:40.160
Using the Orichalcos's power, Valon's Armor Deck unleashes its full strength.

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:44.960
Its overwhelming destructive power can damage Jonouchi's body.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:48.130
This isn't a duel!  It's a fight!

00:23:48.130 --> 00:23:50.570
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Full Armor Gravitation

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.060
Duel, standby!
